# left-upper-cta.js — Left Upper CTA Button Behavior

## Layman's terms

Powers the floating left-upper CTA button (e.g. "Schedule a Tour"). Handles show/hide, click, or scroll-based visibility. Template for pages that need a prominent floating CTA.

## Medium understanding

Template component for the left-upper floating CTA pattern. May include scroll-triggered visibility, click handlers, or modal integration. Copy to Dev when building pages with this CTA style. Mirrors Components/Buttons/ structure.

## Advanced

- **Location:** Templates/Components/Buttons/Floating Buttons/Left Upper CTA/
- **Template:** Not live; used as scaffold
